<title>USA: Z-Seven sets share buyback.</title>
<headline>Z-Seven sets share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>MESA, Ariz. 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Z-Seven Fund Inc on Friday said it  planned to repurchase 349,105 shares of its stock from Agape Co SA,  its largest shareholder.</p>
<p>The repurchase is expected to be completed over an 18-month period  following approval by the Securities and Exchange Commission.</p>
</text>
